# A program's function named like a host word takes its own arity only (shadowing per arity, as library words'):
# the host word of another count of values stays (card paint-samples-branch)
'clock(x) := x; clock() > 0 and clock(7) == 7'	true
'sleep_ms(a, b) := a + b; sleep_ms(1); sleep_ms(2, 3)'	5
'paint([1, 0], 2, 1); 1'	1
'paint((column, row) => column, 2, 1); 2'	2
